### Non-Functional Test Scenarios

ID	Test Scenario	Objective	Related NFR
NTS-001	Verify system performance	
Verify that public pages, search functionality, and the interactive map perform within acceptable response times under normal operating conditions.	NFR-001 – NFR-003
NTS-002	Verify system usability	
Verify that the website provides consistent navigation, layout, and clear validation and error messages across all public pages.	NFR-004 – NFR-006
NTS-003	Verify accessibility features	
Verify that accessibility settings support text size adjustment, contrast options, and restoring default settings.	NFR-007 – NFR-009
NTS-004	Verify system compatibility	
Verify that the website functions correctly across supported web browsers and provides a responsive user interface on different screen sizes and devices.	NFR-010 – NFR-011
NTS-005	Verify system security	
Verify that user authentication, credential transmission, and input validation comply with the defined security requirements.	NFR-012 – NFR-014
NTS-006	Verify system reliability	
Verify that the system remains available during normal operation, handles invalid input without failures, and provides appropriate messages when operations cannot be completed.	NFR-015 – NFR-017
